---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kettlebird Creations • Design system locked"
  description="Milestone 2 delivers the UPA-inspired palette, typography pairings, textured kit, and brand assets for build-out."
>
  <section class="paper-shell stack">
    <h2>Design system snapshot</h2>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>✅ UPA-inspired palette with accessible contrast pairs and ink splash accents.</li>
      <li>✅ Typography hierarchy: sketchy headings + clean body, with fluid clamp sizing.</li>
      <li>✅ Textured paper surface, torn edge treatment, and hand-drawn borders/buttons.</li>
      <li>✅ Logo/mark directions, icon line set, and motion guidance (ink bleed + wiggle).</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h3><span class="badge">Palette</span> Color & contrast</h3>
      <div class="swatches">
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatch:#d95d39">
          <p class="swatch__name">Burnt Orange</p>
          <p class="swatch__meta">Primary • AAA on paper</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatch:#2a9d8f">
          <p class="swatch__name">Teal</p>
          <p class="swatch__meta">Accent • CTA hover</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatch:#f4a261">
          <p class="swatch__name">Amber</p>
          <p class="swatch__meta">Secondary fill</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swatch" style="--swatch:#264653; color: #f5f1e8;">
          <p class="swatch__name">Ink Night</p>
          <p class="swatch__meta">Text on texture</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">
        Paper neutrals (#f5f1e8/#e8e3d8) keep warmth; splatter brights (#e63946, #06ffa5) for micro-accents.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3><span class="badge">Type</span> Typography stack</h3>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="pill">
          <p class="pill__eyebrow">Display</p>
          <p class="pill__value">Caveat / Patrick Hand — sketch headers, badges</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill">
          <p class="pill__eyebrow">Body</p>
          <p class="pill__value">DM Sans — clean reading, UI labels</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill">
          <p class="pill__eyebrow">Scale</p>
          <p class="pill__value">Clamp(1rem, 1.2vw + 0.9rem, 1.35rem) for fluid rhythm</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">
        Headlines carry ink-shadow underline; body keeps high legibility with 1.7 line-height; buttons use hand-drawn
        outline and jitter on hover (prefers-reduced-motion respected).
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3><span class="badge">Texture</span> Paper & strokes</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Layered paper grain with multiply blend; subtle deckle edge footer/headers.</li>
        <li>Hand-drawn borders via irregular radii + SVG roughen filter.</li>
        <li>Ink splatter SVGs for section dividers and CTA highlights.</li>
        <li>Motion: 120ms ease-out wiggle on hover; reduced-motion disables shake.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-shell stack">
    <h2>Brand & layout cues</h2>
    <p class="lede">Logo marks explore a perched kettlebird silhouette within a torn-circle badge; social icons match line weight.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <h3>Hero concept</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│  Grainy paper, ink splatter │
│  Hand-drawn logomark        │
│  CTA with rough border      │
│  Radial nav tucked right    │
└─────────────────────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Gallery cards</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Filters: pills      │
│ [ink underline]     │
├─────────────────────┤
│░░ paper ░░░░░░░░░░  │
│ cards w/ torn edge  │
│ hover wobble + info │
└─────────────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Comic reader</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌───────────────┐
│ Page viewport │
│ [Panel guide] │
│ ◀ Prev  Next ▶│
│ Progress 3/12 │
│ Toolbar: zoom │
└───────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Written works</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌───────────────┐
│ Cover/Title   │
│ Page flip UI  │
│ 1 2 3 4 5 ... │
│ TOC | Scroll  │
│ Mode toggle   │
└───────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-shell stack">
    <h2>Next implementation steps</h2>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>🖼️ Build gallery grid + PhotoSwipe lightbox using the locked palette + textures.</li>
      <li>📚 Wire Sanity content to hero/gallery; load palette tokens as CSS vars from config.</li>
      <li>🚀 Prep component stories with the brand kit for QA (buttons, cards, filters).</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
